Yj3N2gQ3IcHCKABKAw",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwiBl8nE9tmWAxXLqpUCHYj3N2gQ3IcHCKEBKA0",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwiBl8nE9tmWAxXLqpUCHYj3N2gQ3IcHCKIBKA4",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiBl8nE9tmWAxXLqpUCHYj3N2gQ3YcHCKQBKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwiBl8nE9tmWAxXLqpUCHYj3N2gQ3IcHCKMBKA8",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiBl8nE9tmWAxXLqpUCHYj3N2gQ3YcHCKYBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiBl8nE9tmWAxXLqpUCHYj3N2gQ3IcHCKUBKBA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["連假前的中午，原本跟著採購同事的步伐，準備往「爭鮮」方向移動，沒料到半路殺出一家「麵匡匡拉麵食堂」，那招牌硬是將我目光吸住。同事回頭給了個乾脆的「讚」，就像一道聖旨，鼓勵我入內一探。\n\n店內是經典的長條型空間，前方吧檯區能直擊工作人員的廚房戰況，雖然有些桌面還未及時清理，但這份忙碌倒也體現了生意的熱絡。點餐入座，我輕鬆用Line Pay支付並掃碼積點，桌上那張國中小學生段考滿分免費吃麵的廣告尤其吸睛，給了這間店一種清新又暖心的鄰家氣氛。\n\n我點了180元的招牌豚骨拉麵。餐點上桌，首先被那豪邁的肉量震懾，湯頭濃郁，但加入了玉米筍與花椰菜，明顯感受到這是個台式改良版的日式拉麵，麵體與配菜的搭配讓整體口感更加豐富且平價，同事的推薦果然是實在的好。\n\n我邊吃麵，邊瞄了一眼新聞，可惜股市又創新高，錯過了這班致富列車，不知該喜還該憂。",null,[0,91]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18389778852401911248/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VFZFeVVrbGFWemxTVWpCa1JXSnNXa2hOTUU1RVpHeGFTMUpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18389778852401911248/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VFZFeVVrbGFWemxTVWpCa1JXSnNXa2hOTUU1RVpHeGFTMUpYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/18389778852401911248/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VFZFeVVrbGFWemxTVWpCa1JXSnNXa2hOTUU1RVpHeGFTMUpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18389778852401911248/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUl